{"chars": "Then the sleigh followed the coast, south and south and south. They flew over snowy mountains that came right down to the sea, where giant rivers of ice, called glaciers, crept down the valleys and broke off at the water's edge in great blue-white chunks, KER-SPLASH!, into the ocean. They flew over hundreds of green, forested islands, scattered in the sea like stepping stones. And down in the dark blue water, Mrs. Claus spotted a puff of mist, then another, and then a huge dark back curving up out of the waves, and a giant tail lifting high in the air before it slipped back down, sploosh.", "start": [0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.412, 0.412, 0.412, 0.412, 0.512, 0.512, 0.512, 0.512, 0.512, 0.512, 0.512, 0.887, 0.887, 0.887, 0.887, 0.887, 0.887, 0.887, 0.887, 0.887, 1.188, 1.188, 1.188, 1.188, 1.312, 1.312, 1.312, 1.312, 1.312, 1.312, 1.9, 2.038, 2.038, 2.038, 2.038, 2.038, 2.038, 2.4, 2.4, 2.4, 2.4, 2.562, 2.562, 2.562, 2.562, 2.562, 2.562, 2.925, 2.925, 2.925, 2.925, 3.087, 3.087, 3.087, 3.087, 3.087, 3.087, 3.925, 4.025, 4.025, 4.025, 4.025, 4.025, 4.213, 4.213, 4.213, 4.213, 4.213, 4.438, 4.438, 4.438, 4.438, 4.438, 4.7, 4.7, 4.7, 4.7, 4.7, 4.7, 5.1, 5.1, 5.1, 5.1, 5.1, 5.1, 5.1, 5.1, 5.1, 5.1, 5.625, 5.625, 5.625, 5.625, 5.625, 5.75, 5.75, 5.75, 5.75, 5.75, 6.0, 6.0, 6.0, 6.0, 6.0, 6.0, 6.275, 6.275, 6.275, 6.275, 6.275, 6.525, 6.525, 6.525, 6.625, 6.625, 6.625, 6.625, 6.775, 6.775, 6.775, 6.775, 7.4, 7.5, 7.5, 7.5, 7.5, 7.5, 7.5, 7.688, 7.688, 7.688, 7.688, 7.688, 7.688, 8.025, 8.025, 8.025, 8.025, 8.025, 8.025, 8.025, 8.312, 8.312, 8.312, 8.425, 8.425, 8.425, 8.425, 8.95, 9.05, 9.05, 9.05, 9.05, 9.05, 9.05, 9.05, 9.35, 9.35, 9.35, 9.35, 9.35, 9.35, 9.35, 9.35, 9.35, 10.1, 10.2, 10.2, 10.2, 10.2, 10.2, 10.2, 10.5, 10.5, 10.5, 10.5, 10.5, 10.738, 10.738, 10.738, 10.738, 10.825, 10.825, 10.825, 10.825, 10.825, 10.825, 10.825, 10.825, 11.4, 11.4, 11.4, 11.4, 11.525, 11.525, 11.525, 11.525, 11.525, 11.525, 11.762, 11.762, 11.762, 11.762, 11.912, 11.912, 11.9